        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Jordan dui kanpat pui nung kiu",
            "Gaichuimei kaidai khou tei",
            "Thuak lou mei nun rui thuan bam mei",
            "Kaniu lun tei ai hou ni.",
            "",
            "He! Poubao mei zeipan rui heiram gai tei",
            "Kasiam lou the aniu kaguay na khang",
            "Anuan kaguay na hei kuak lou ngam kan the",
            "Ti than lou ngam the kazei haeng paan rui.",
            "",
            "2. Poubaomei bampui ramc gaimei",
            "Ai rui nkhuan lian lak khe",
            "Ringmei thing bang limv gaimei khou",
            "Bui nung rui zaeng suni cho?",
            "",
            "3. Tingkao Jerusalem than gai",
            "Karam gai sa ngam mak ge",
            "Khou tei jisu rui khuan bam e",
            "Nam than gaimei khou gut khang.",
            "",
            "4. Kanloumei pu daeng tang pu khou",
            "Lung rianra meinai lak khe",
            "Pap puat nritmei phungmei guay",
            "Hei khou tei lou kei ni the."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
